  "jei.edu.element_constructor.particles": "Protons %s, Neutrons %s, Electrons %s",
  "jei.edu.info.allow": "Anyone can build above an Allow block, even in an Immutable World. Only World Builders can place or break it.",
  "jei.edu.info.border": "An invisible wall that reaches all the way up and down: no one can pass through it or build past it, unless they are a World Builder.",
  "jei.edu.info.camera": "Place it to set up a tripod and click it to take your picture after a countdown, or sneak and use it to take a close-up. Pictures go into your Portfolio.",
  "jei.edu.info.chalkboard": "Write on it to share notes and signs. Slates are 1x1, Posters 2x1 and Boards 3x2, on a wall or standing on their own. World Builders can lock them so only World Builders can change the writing.",
  "jei.edu.info.deny": "No one can build above a Deny block, unless they are a World Builder. Only World Builders can place or break it.",
  "jei.edu.info.material_reducer": "Breaks blocks and compounds down into their elements. It has no crafting recipe: find it in the Creative inventory (Education Edition tab, Lab Equipment).",
  "jei.edu.info.npc": "Places an NPC that players can talk to. World Builders can give it a skin, dialogue and buttons that run commands.",
  "jei.edu.info.portfolio": "Holds the pictures you take with the Camera: add captions, delete them, turn them into photos or export them as a PDF.",
